    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>When this plugin is installed, you’ll be able to sign up for the <a href=\"https://sendwp.com/?utm_source=wordpress-org&amp;utm_medium=promo-link&amp;utm_campaign=readme&amp;utm_content=sendwp\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">SendWP</a> service from the SendWP menu page. Once you’re signed up, all your WordPress emails will be routed through sendwp.com. We know that sending all your email through a third-party can be scary, so please can check out our privacy policy and terms and conditions.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Install and activate SendWP.</li>\n<li>Visit the SendWP admin menu page.</li>\n<li>Click on the &#8220;Connect&#8221; button.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "<p>Q. Is the SendWP service free?<br />\nA. No. SendWP is a paid service.</p>\n<p>Q. Does this plugin work without signing up for the SendWP service?<br />\nA. No. This plugin only serves to connect you to the SendWP service, so if you don’t use the service, the plugin doesn’t have anything to do.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.4.9</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Bug fixes and improvements.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.4.7</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Behind the scenes udpates preparing for new features.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.4.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixes issue for some users with our new support process library.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.4.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixes a few bugs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Adds trusted login as a better way to give support access to investigate issues</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Say hello to the easy solution to transactional email in WordPress.",
    "description": "<p>When this plugin is installed, you’ll be able to sign up for the <a href=\"https://sendwp.com/?utm_source=wordpress-org&amp;utm_medium=promo-link&amp;utm_campaign=readme&amp;utm_content=sendwp\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">SendWP</a> service from the SendWP menu page. Once you’re signed up, all your WordPress emails will be routed through sendwp.com. We know that sending all your email through a third-party can be scary, so please can check out our privacy policy and terms and conditions.</p>\n",
